  "details": "It would be great to separate the Looks Editor from the current \"Main Menu\" setup.\n\nIt's very inconvenient in Desktop Mode (VR is somewhat okay), and editing the attachment point in particular feels pretty clunky.\n\nWhy not open it in a separate UI, similar to the Debug View, which could then be scaled larger and provide more space for all the options, especially for selecting attachment points?\n\n/Edit\n\nOr at least add a Button \"Advanced Editor\" or something to open it in a different GUI\n\nThanksies~ <3\n\nAlso recommending this to upvote: https://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/allow-accessory-bones-to-be-selected-from-a-list",
